{
 "encounter_id": "00861",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, doctor, I've done my back. Lifting a patient at work, a big chap, he slipped, and I caught him, and something went in my lower back. It's been three days. I'm a nurse, I should know better, and my mum says it's because I never stretch."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ouch. A spasm in the lower back, three days ago. Is that right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a back spasm, right across the bottom. I couldn't get out of the car."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the pain go anywhere?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Down the left leg, as far as the knee. Not below."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it feel stiff?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Stiff, like a board, especially in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about coughing or sneezing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, I yelp when I cough. The cat sneezed and I nearly died."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, some important questions. Any numbness between your legs, in the saddle area?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no numbness there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble passing urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my bladder's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Bowels? Any loss of control?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weakness in the legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No weakness, I can walk. Slowly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What have you taken?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, three times a day. And paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything in your medical background?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, migraine, and a bit of scoliosis since my teens."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A caesarean, in 2016."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Back problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum has bad back trouble. Dad has high blood pressure, no, that's irrelevant, sorry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about your work."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a nurse on a care ward. Lots of lifting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smoking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gin at the weekend, a couple."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Zumba on Wednesdays, though not this week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let me check you. Pulse 76, blood pressure 124 over 78, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, weight 68 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal then? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Now, I'll feel along your back. Tell me where it's worst.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There. And there. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness and tightness in the muscles on the left side of the lower back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mm. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lift your left leg straight, lying down. Does that reproduce the leg pain?",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit, at about forty degrees. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So the straight leg raise is mildly positive on the left."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problem with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my asthma's quiet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problem with your water or tummy, apart from what we've said?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me repeat what I think. A pulled muscle in the lower back, but I can't rule out a slipped disc pressing on a nerve, given the leg pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need a scan? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not today. I'd like to arrange physiotherapy for you, and an X-ray of the spine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the leg pain isn't better in two weeks, I'd like to arrange an MRI of your lower back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. And if it gets worse? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get numbness between your legs, or any trouble with your bladder or bowels, go straight to the emergency department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. Is that the only red flag? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The main one. Keep moving, gentle walking, no bed rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Alright, thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it's not better in two weeks, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
